---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Weng Jialin">
  <div class="prose max-w-none">
    <h1 class="text-title">About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Weng Jialin, a software engineer at an internet company.
      You can reach me at <a href="mailto:christry.stool@gmail.com">christry.stool@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What I'm Working On</h2>
    <p>
      Building AI Agent infrastructure — Agent Sandbox, <a href="https://modelcontextprotocol.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MCP</a> / <a href="https://agentskills.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Skills</a> Platform,
      Agent Gateway, Agent frameworks — that powers various AI Agent applications
      across the company. Also responsible for <a href="https://platformengineering.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Platform Engineering</a>,
      Engineering Productivity, and <a href="https://github.blog/enterprise-software/collaboration/developer-experience-what-is-it-and-why-should-you-care/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developer Experience</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Interests</h2>
    <p>
      My main technical focus is backend systems and infrastructure. Because I also work on company-wide CI/CD and testing infrastructure across frontend, mobile, and backend teams,
      I stay involved with frontend and mobile engineering concerns as well.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm interested in formal methods, system-level specifications, and how they help reason about complex systems; I wrote more about this in <a href="/blog/formal-methods-ai-coding">Formal Methods × AI Coding</a>.
      While building AI Agent infrastructure, I keep organizing related knowledge through writing on this site, including <a href="/blog/agent-sandbox">Agent Sandbox</a>,
      <a href="/blog/agent-observability">Agent Observability</a>, and <a href="/blog/harness-ai-agent">Agent Harness engineering</a>.
      I recently also built <a href="https://inference-engineering.wengjialin.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Inference Engineering Chinese Translation</a>,
      a Chinese translation site for an inference engineering e-book, to make it easier for the team to study these ideas together.
    </p>

    <h2>Projects</h2>

    <h3>AI Agent Infrastructure</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Agent Sandbox Platform</strong> — secure sandbox environments for AI Agents (core developer)</li>
      <li><strong>MCP / Skills Platform</strong> — MCP / skill management platform & marketplace (core developer)</li>
      <li><strong>Agent Gateway</strong> — governable gateway for internal protocol translation and agent-to-LLM, MCP/tool, and external API traffic with authorization, audit, observability, and policy controls (core developer)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Platform Engineering & Productivity</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>AI Coding Adoption</strong> — driving company-wide AI-assisted coding adoption, toolchain integration, workflow optimization, and developer enablement (core driver)</li>
      <li><strong>CI/CD Infrastructure</strong> — continuous integration and delivery pipelines (core maintainer)</li>
      <li><strong>API Platform</strong> — API interface management (core developer)</li>
      <li><strong>Traffic Recording & Replay</strong> — production traffic capture and replay (core developer)</li>
      <li><strong>Load Testing Platform</strong> — performance & load testing infrastructure (core developer)</li>
      <li><strong>Precision Testing System</strong> — targeted test execution based on code changes (core developer)</li>
      <li><strong>Chaos Engineering Platform</strong> — fault injection and resilience testing (core developer)</li>
      <li><strong>Microservice Deploy & Ops</strong> — deployment and operations system (developer)</li>
      <li><strong>Container Deploy System</strong> — Kubernetes-based container deployment and orchestration platform (developer)</li>
      <li><strong>P2P Artifact Distribution</strong> — P2P distribution for images & build packages (developer)</li>
      <li><strong>Bare-metal Deploy System</strong> — physical machine deployment (developer)</li>
      <li><strong>Dynamic Config & A/B Testing</strong> — feature flags and A/B testing (developer)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
